1
00:00:00,792 --> 00:00:04,587
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:11,302 --> 00:00:14,055
[Emilia] <i>I like a man who knows</i>
<i>how to please his woman.</i>

3
00:00:14,139 --> 00:00:16,433
[Claire] <i>You're falling for that</i>
<i>masked creature, Emilia.</i>

4
00:00:16,516 --> 00:00:19,477
<i>It's the other way around.</i>
<i>He is falling for me.</i>

5
00:00:19,561 --> 00:00:20,729
[Erlinda] <i>Who are you?</i>

6
00:00:20,812 --> 00:00:25,775
<i>Let's just say I'm your boss</i>
<i>Jaguar's worst nightmare.</i>

7
00:00:25,859 --> 00:00:29,487
<i>Can you please tell him to let</i>
<i>Diego Torillo out of prison?</i>

8
00:00:29,571 --> 00:00:31,114
<i>I don't need to anymore.</i>

9
00:00:31,197 --> 00:00:33,074
<i>Torillo already met up with Jaguar.</i>

10
00:00:33,158 --> 00:00:35,869
<i>I'm running for governor</i>
<i>of Ardiente because</i>

11
00:00:35,952 --> 00:00:39,456
<i>I want to change this town,</i>
<i>not become a puppet.</i>

12
00:00:39,539 --> 00:00:43,585
<i>I am doing this to get justice</i>
<i>for my mother.</i>

13
00:00:43,668 --> 00:00:46,504
<i>And most importantly, to free</i>
<i>my father from their clutches.</i>

14
00:00:46,588 --> 00:00:50,091
<i>We have an invitation</i>
<i>from the rival party.</i>

15
00:00:50,175 --> 00:00:52,594
<i>They said we shouldn't miss it.</i>

16
00:00:52,677 --> 00:00:57,432
<i>Let me introduce you all</i>
<i>to your future first lady.</i>

17
00:00:57,515 --> 00:00:58,975
[cheering]

18
00:00:59,059 --> 00:01:02,062
<i>Ivy Aguas, will you marry me?</i>

19
00:01:02,145 --> 00:01:04,355
<i>-Yes. Yes!</i>
<i>-Yes!</i>

20
00:01:04,439 --> 00:01:07,942
<i>Diego! Diego! Diego! Diego! Diego!</i>

21
00:01:08,026 --> 00:01:09,069
<i>So!</i>

22
00:01:09,903 --> 00:01:13,490
<i>Were you surprised?!</i>
<i>Yes, I'm a free man now!</i>

23
00:01:13,573 --> 00:01:16,993
<i>-Diego! Diego!</i>
<i>-Shut your trap! I said shut it!</i>

24
00:01:17,077 --> 00:01:20,789
<i>-Diego! Diego!</i>
<i>-Hon! Hon! No! No. Hon.</i>

25
00:01:20,872 --> 00:01:24,125
<i>We have to show the other side</i>
<i>of Diego to the people.</i>

26
00:01:24,209 --> 00:01:29,297
<i>We should inform everyone</i>
<i>that Diego also receives</i>

27
00:01:29,380 --> 00:01:32,926
<i>help from criminals like Jaguar.</i>

28
00:01:33,009 --> 00:01:37,388
<i>Finally. This will bring about</i>
<i>your downfall, Diego Torillo.</i>

29
00:01:52,737 --> 00:01:54,572
<i>One more wrong move</i>
<i>and I'll finish him off.</i>

30
00:01:54,656 --> 00:01:55,782
<i>He's your dad.</i>

31
00:01:55,865 --> 00:01:58,284
<i>He's better off as fertilizer,</i>

32
00:01:58,368 --> 00:02:00,662
<i>just like Nimfa and soon enough, Diego.</i>

33
00:02:00,745 --> 00:02:01,788
<i>Ouch!</i>

34
00:02:03,456 --> 00:02:05,333
<i>Who will you meet with, Ivy?</i>

35
00:02:06,584 --> 00:02:08,419
<i>I knew you'd come here.</i>

36
00:02:08,503 --> 00:02:10,380
<i>-Diego! Diego!</i>
<i>-Shut your trap!</i>

37
00:02:10,463 --> 00:02:13,133
<i>-Diego! Diego!</i>
<i>-Hon! Hon, no! No!</i>

38
00:02:14,134 --> 00:02:15,135
<i>Hon…</i>

39
00:02:19,597 --> 00:02:21,474
-[door opens]
-Hon?

40
00:02:26,521 --> 00:02:30,692
Hon, why are you on the floor? Come here.

41
00:02:31,693 --> 00:02:34,070
Hon… That's enough.

42
00:02:37,323 --> 00:02:38,324
Give me that.

43
00:02:40,243 --> 00:02:41,828
-What's going on?
-Where were you?

44
00:02:43,121 --> 00:02:45,373
I just had to go home
and take care of some things.

45
00:02:45,456 --> 00:02:46,457
[scoffs]

46
00:02:47,750 --> 00:02:49,043
Well, the last time you said that

47
00:02:49,127 --> 00:02:51,045
you visited him in prison
without my knowledge.

48
00:02:51,462 --> 00:02:53,882
So, did you check on him
since he just got out of jail?

49
00:02:54,591 --> 00:02:57,719
Well? Did you celebrate?
Open a bottle of wine?

50
00:02:57,802 --> 00:03:00,555
Hug? Kiss? Did you sleep with him?

51
00:03:02,140 --> 00:03:03,600
Didn't I tell you--

52
00:03:03,683 --> 00:03:05,852
I don't care what you say, got it?

53
00:03:06,436 --> 00:03:08,730
Diego's nothing but trash. I'm better.

54
00:03:08,813 --> 00:03:11,065
And he has no right
to be the governor of this town

55
00:03:11,149 --> 00:03:12,525
because he's no Ardiente.

56
00:03:12,609 --> 00:03:13,526
Arnaldo!

57
00:03:13,610 --> 00:03:17,196
I'll do everything I can to stop him.

58
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:19,532
Even if that means I have to keep killing!

59
00:03:19,908 --> 00:03:21,951
As long as it keeps him away from you!

60
00:03:22,035 --> 00:03:23,036
[grunts]

61
00:03:23,703 --> 00:03:24,996
Let go! [groans]

62
00:03:26,289 --> 00:03:27,206
Arnaldo!

63
00:03:28,249 --> 00:03:29,792
I said, let go!

64
00:03:29,876 --> 00:03:33,129
[groaning]

65
00:03:33,546 --> 00:03:34,464
Arnaldo!

66
00:03:36,382 --> 00:03:38,509
[cries] Stop!

67
00:03:39,552 --> 00:03:41,888
Arnaldo, please! Please, no!

68
00:03:42,722 --> 00:03:43,765
[screams]

69
00:03:45,308 --> 00:03:46,517
[Ivy screams] Help!

70
00:03:46,601 --> 00:03:48,186
Arnaldo, please!

71
00:03:53,066 --> 00:03:54,025
[Ivy] Arnaldo!

72
00:03:54,525 --> 00:03:55,568
Arnaldo!

73
00:03:57,237 --> 00:04:01,741
-[Ivy sobbing]
-[tense music playing]

74
00:04:13,878 --> 00:04:16,047
-Ivy…
-No!

75
00:04:21,970 --> 00:04:24,180
[breathing heavily]

76
00:04:25,431 --> 00:04:29,686
[tense music playing]

77
00:04:32,522 --> 00:04:34,524
<i>Your days are numbered, Arnaldo.</i>

78
00:04:34,607 --> 00:04:37,860
<i>I promise you, I'll make</i>
<i>your life a living hell.</i>

79
00:04:39,862 --> 00:04:41,698
[sniffles, exhales]

80
00:04:42,573 --> 00:04:43,574
Ivy…

81
00:04:49,372 --> 00:04:50,623
What's happening to you?

82
00:04:55,128 --> 00:04:57,046
[Arnaldo sobs]

83
00:05:03,886 --> 00:05:05,722
You just couldn't leave your son alone.

84
00:05:06,973 --> 00:05:09,851
You still have a lot of people to fool

85
00:05:09,934 --> 00:05:15,648
and a lot of people to pay…
just to get Diego out.

86
00:05:16,566 --> 00:05:18,401
It was going to end up that way.

87
00:05:19,235 --> 00:05:20,778
He would've gotten out.

88
00:05:21,821 --> 00:05:25,575
The only difference is
I got him out earlier.

89
00:05:27,660 --> 00:05:29,078
It's better that way.

90
00:05:30,288 --> 00:05:32,498
So that he can fight
the Ardientes properly.

91
00:05:32,582 --> 00:05:33,750
Jaguar.

92
00:05:34,584 --> 00:05:38,379
Now that Diego is free,
you should focus on Emilia.

93
00:05:39,797 --> 00:05:40,882
Use her.

94
00:05:41,424 --> 00:05:43,968
So that you can get
all of the Ardientes' wealth.

95
00:05:46,763 --> 00:05:48,264
Don't worry about Emilia.

96
00:05:49,891 --> 00:05:51,225
I'm already working on it.

97
00:05:51,309 --> 00:05:54,729
[tense music playing]

98
00:06:10,286 --> 00:06:12,997
Grandpa, about last night--

99
00:06:13,081 --> 00:06:17,752
Your explanation means nothing to me.

100
00:06:21,672 --> 00:06:24,258
Finish your breakfast.
We're going somewhere.

101
00:06:26,427 --> 00:06:28,679
What do you mean? I have
a meeting with my staff later.

102
00:06:31,140 --> 00:06:34,477
Well, it's not like you'll win
if you keep acting

103
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:36,562
like you're on the verge of a breakdown.

104
00:06:37,563 --> 00:06:39,690
[Arnaldo] <i>And he has no right</i>
<i>to be the governor of this town</i>

105
00:06:39,774 --> 00:06:41,150
<i>because he's no Ardiente.</i>

106
00:06:41,234 --> 00:06:42,151
[Ivy] <i>Arnaldo!</i>

107
00:06:42,235 --> 00:06:45,822
[Arnaldo] <i>I'll do everything</i>
<i>I can to stop him.</i>

108
00:06:45,905 --> 00:06:47,907
<i>Even if that means I have to keep killing!</i>

109
00:06:47,990 --> 00:06:49,659
<i>As long as it keeps him away from you!</i>

110
00:06:49,742 --> 00:06:51,744
Attorney, isn't that enough evidence?

111
00:06:51,828 --> 00:06:54,330
He should be in prison
for everything he's done

112
00:06:54,413 --> 00:06:55,832
and for harassing Ivy!

113
00:06:55,915 --> 00:06:58,543
This sounds like a confession,
but it's just a threat.

114
00:06:59,043 --> 00:07:01,754
And until something bad happens to Diego,

115
00:07:01,838 --> 00:07:03,673
this declaration is unfounded.

116
00:07:03,756 --> 00:07:05,758
Therefore, we cannot use it as evidence.

117
00:07:06,884 --> 00:07:11,681
As for harassment…
Ivy, did Arnaldo hurt you?

118
00:07:13,558 --> 00:07:16,269
Arnaldo is going crazy, Attorney.

119
00:07:16,352 --> 00:07:18,187
That's why he's becoming violent.

120
00:07:19,897 --> 00:07:21,482
Ivy, stay away from him.

121
00:07:21,566 --> 00:07:25,361
Lily, this is way too dangerous now.

122
00:07:26,154 --> 00:07:28,948
We can easily ruin Arnaldo's reputation.

123
00:07:29,031 --> 00:07:31,784
But that means you'll now have to face

124
00:07:31,868 --> 00:07:33,327
Arnaldo and the Ardientes.

125
00:07:33,411 --> 00:07:35,329
I've thought about that, Attorney.

126
00:07:35,788 --> 00:07:39,750
I mean, about ruining Arnaldo.
That's always been my plan.

127
00:07:40,751 --> 00:07:45,006
But then, I also know
the Ardientes fight dirty.

128
00:07:46,174 --> 00:07:48,050
Just like what they did to Diego.

129
00:07:48,926 --> 00:07:51,596
How they turned the tables on him.

130
00:07:51,679 --> 00:07:54,098
They can do that to me too.

131
00:07:57,852 --> 00:08:00,354
These are just pills to calm your nerves

132
00:08:00,438 --> 00:08:03,232
and to manage your stress
and your volatile emotions.

133
00:08:04,525 --> 00:08:06,360
This is your solution?

134
00:08:07,445 --> 00:08:08,362
Pills.

135
00:08:08,446 --> 00:08:10,781
I don't need this. I'm not crazy!

136
00:08:10,865 --> 00:08:12,241
I don't have time for this, Grandpa.

137
00:08:12,325 --> 00:08:16,037
I know you're not crazy, okay?
I know you're not mad, but…

138
00:08:16,704 --> 00:08:21,042
Just take the medication.
Just follow the doctor, okay?

139
00:08:21,417 --> 00:08:22,418
Listen to me.

140
00:08:23,669 --> 00:08:27,757
You are stressed out
because Diego was freed.

141
00:08:28,508 --> 00:08:32,929
You're worried and paranoid that
you might lose the election.

142
00:08:33,554 --> 00:08:36,516
And to top it all off,
whether you admit it or not,

143
00:08:36,599 --> 00:08:39,101
you're jealous and you're fearful

144
00:08:39,185 --> 00:08:42,730
that Ivy might leave you for Diego.

145
00:08:42,813 --> 00:08:43,856
[scoffs]

146
00:08:43,940 --> 00:08:46,150
You think you'll last long in politics

147
00:08:46,234 --> 00:08:48,361
without popping a few pills?!

148
00:08:49,779 --> 00:08:52,156
Just take the darn medication!

149
00:08:53,824 --> 00:08:55,243
It'll be good for you.

150
00:09:03,751 --> 00:09:05,419
What will you do now, Lily?

151
00:09:06,128 --> 00:09:08,714
How will we fight Arnaldo?

152
00:09:08,798 --> 00:09:09,882
By force.

153
00:09:14,136 --> 00:09:17,139
All my life, I've fought fairly.

154
00:09:17,765 --> 00:09:19,267
But if there's one thing I've learned,

155
00:09:19,350 --> 00:09:22,853
it's to learn how to play rough
to protect my loved ones.

156
00:09:37,660 --> 00:09:41,080
Well, Attorney…
I think I have a better idea.

157
00:09:41,163 --> 00:09:44,125
I'll continue my plans of ruining Arnaldo.

158
00:09:44,208 --> 00:09:48,838
I'll drive him insane so I can
totally crush and destroy him.

159
00:09:48,921 --> 00:09:52,049
Until Emilia and Julio go crazy too.

160
00:09:52,133 --> 00:09:54,552
All because of what's
happening to Arnaldo.

161
00:09:55,052 --> 00:09:57,096
I'll make the Ardientes go crazy.

162
00:10:15,656 --> 00:10:16,657
[door opens]

163
00:10:55,363 --> 00:10:57,239
[tense music playing]

164
00:11:15,257 --> 00:11:17,968
[groaning]

165
00:11:27,853 --> 00:11:28,938
[pants]

166
00:11:34,318 --> 00:11:37,029
[breathing heavily]

167
00:11:41,659 --> 00:11:42,910
What's happening?

168
00:11:51,043 --> 00:11:52,336
[groans]

169
00:12:20,322 --> 00:12:22,700
[tense music playing]

170
00:12:47,099 --> 00:12:48,392
[groans]

171
00:12:53,314 --> 00:12:55,441
[tense music playing]

172
00:13:05,576 --> 00:13:07,995
[hyperventilating]

173
00:13:18,047 --> 00:13:19,089
<i>What's happening?</i>

174
00:13:29,558 --> 00:13:31,060
[gasps]

175
00:13:35,981 --> 00:13:36,857
Hon.

176
00:13:37,525 --> 00:13:39,568
Hon, I'm sorry.

177
00:13:40,444 --> 00:13:41,946
I'm-- I'm sorry.

178
00:13:42,780 --> 00:13:44,657
I'm sorry for what I did last night.

179
00:13:44,740 --> 00:13:47,034
It won't happen again. I'm sorry.

180
00:13:49,119 --> 00:13:50,120
I'm sorry.

181
00:13:51,580 --> 00:13:52,540
I'm sorry.

182
00:13:52,623 --> 00:13:55,459
[labored breathing]

183
00:13:56,502 --> 00:14:00,923
<i>You'll pay for killing</i>
<i>Nanny Carlotta and Nimfa,</i>

184
00:14:01,006 --> 00:14:02,758
<i>for having Diego imprisoned,</i>

185
00:14:02,841 --> 00:14:05,761
<i>and for murdering those</i>
<i>innocent witnesses.</i>

186
00:14:06,470 --> 00:14:10,391
<i>I won't kill you, but I'll destroy you.</i>

187
00:14:11,183 --> 00:14:14,019
<i>I'll rob you of your sanity, Arnaldo.</i>

188
00:14:14,103 --> 00:14:19,817
<i>I won't leave a shred of it.</i>
<i>I'll make you lose your mind…</i>

189
00:14:20,401 --> 00:14:23,821
<i>to the point that you'll beg for death.</i>

190
00:14:27,491 --> 00:14:32,663
I… I want to apologize
for what happened last night.

191
00:14:35,499 --> 00:14:36,584
It…

192
00:14:38,752 --> 00:14:40,004
Hon, it's okay.

193
00:14:40,796 --> 00:14:45,384
I know you're just under a lot of stress.

194
00:14:45,467 --> 00:14:46,552
It's okay.

195
00:14:52,892 --> 00:14:54,351
Come on, eat up.

196
00:15:06,447 --> 00:15:09,283
Hon, I found this
in your bathroom last night.

197
00:15:11,660 --> 00:15:12,745
It's nothing.

198
00:15:16,248 --> 00:15:21,337
Ah… Grandpa thinks I need these pills,

199
00:15:22,254 --> 00:15:23,589
but I really think I don't.

200
00:15:25,758 --> 00:15:27,259
I'm still in control, right?

201
00:15:28,427 --> 00:15:32,306
-Yes. Yes, hon.
-Yes. I am.

202
00:15:32,389 --> 00:15:34,600
-If… If…
-Help yourself.

203
00:15:34,683 --> 00:15:38,354
If I hurt you last night,
I swear it won't happen again.

204
00:15:39,730 --> 00:15:42,942
Okay? Believe me, it won't happen again.

205
00:15:43,025 --> 00:15:44,360
Yes, I believe you.

206
00:15:53,160 --> 00:15:55,245
Sir Arnaldo, a package for you.

207
00:15:56,705 --> 00:15:59,375
Hmm. I wonder who sent it.

208
00:15:59,917 --> 00:16:00,918
Wait.

209
00:16:03,003 --> 00:16:04,546
I have a bad feeling about this.

210
00:16:04,630 --> 00:16:06,006
Maybe it's better
if you don't open it, hon.

211
00:16:06,090 --> 00:16:07,424
Please don't open it.

212
00:16:07,508 --> 00:16:08,968
It's okay. It's okay.

213
00:16:09,051 --> 00:16:09,885
Are you sure?

214
00:16:09,969 --> 00:16:13,180
[ominous music playing]

215
00:16:17,685 --> 00:16:19,937
[tense music playing]

216
00:16:34,451 --> 00:16:37,579
ARNALDO, CONFESS YOUR SINS.
YOUR CONSCIENCE WILL EAT AT YOU.

217
00:16:39,456 --> 00:16:40,457
Hon!

218
00:16:44,128 --> 00:16:45,170
Hon.

219
00:16:46,505 --> 00:16:48,799
Somebody knows about your secrets?

220
00:16:54,138 --> 00:16:56,265
-Who could it be?
-Who sent this?

221
00:16:56,348 --> 00:16:57,558
Who sent it?!

222
00:17:00,144 --> 00:17:01,395
Hon, hon…

223
00:17:01,770 --> 00:17:03,147
I just want to know who sent it.

224
00:17:03,230 --> 00:17:04,565
-No, hon, no.
-No, no, no.

225
00:17:04,648 --> 00:17:06,400
-I'm just going to ask…
-Arnaldo, relax!

226
00:17:06,483 --> 00:17:08,277
-Who sent me this?!
-Hon!

227
00:17:08,360 --> 00:17:09,653
Hon, relax.

228
00:17:10,404 --> 00:17:11,989
I just wanna know who it's from.

229
00:17:12,072 --> 00:17:15,367
I'll do it, hon. I'll find out who it is.

230
00:17:15,909 --> 00:17:17,745
-I just?
-No, hon. Sit down.

231
00:17:17,828 --> 00:17:21,081
Relax. Just ignore it.
It's just a sick joke.

232
00:17:23,042 --> 00:17:25,252
Um… Hon, you need to relax.

233
00:17:25,335 --> 00:17:27,421
We have a food tasting later, okay?

234
00:17:27,504 --> 00:17:30,257
I need you there, hon. I need you there.

235
00:17:31,592 --> 00:17:33,927
-I just wanna know…
-Hon.

236
00:17:34,845 --> 00:17:36,847
I just want to know who sent it…

237
00:17:39,266 --> 00:17:40,267
Who sent it?

238
00:17:42,144 --> 00:17:43,187
Who sent it?

239
00:17:43,645 --> 00:17:44,730
Shh.

240
00:17:52,029 --> 00:17:54,364
[chef] This one is the red
velvet with chocolate ganache.

241
00:17:54,448 --> 00:17:56,658
Then this is carrot cake, while
this is raspberry macadamia.

242
00:17:57,451 --> 00:18:00,370
Okay. Thanks, chef. We'll try them out.

243
00:18:01,747 --> 00:18:03,248
Hon, let's try this one first.

244
00:18:05,709 --> 00:18:07,044
You taste it for us.

245
00:18:07,127 --> 00:18:09,129
I have to watch my diet for my gown.

246
00:18:09,963 --> 00:18:10,881
How was it?

247
00:18:12,132 --> 00:18:13,217
Is it okay?

248
00:18:17,179 --> 00:18:18,222
It's fine.

249
00:18:19,181 --> 00:18:23,352
Chef, do you have other choices?
Can we try more?

250
00:18:23,435 --> 00:18:24,394
Thank you.

251
00:18:25,437 --> 00:18:26,647
Okay, this one.

252
00:18:27,314 --> 00:18:28,315
[Ivy] Hmm.

253
00:18:30,359 --> 00:18:32,736
[ominous music playing]

254
00:18:35,489 --> 00:18:36,949
[choking]

255
00:18:41,245 --> 00:18:42,371
-Yummy.
-[stammering]

256
00:18:44,915 --> 00:18:45,958
Hon?

257
00:18:48,794 --> 00:18:50,420
[ominous music playing]

258
00:18:51,964 --> 00:18:53,298
<i>That's not true!</i>

259
00:18:53,382 --> 00:18:55,759
[gunshots]

260
00:19:01,515 --> 00:19:02,808
-Hon!
-Why?

261
00:19:02,891 --> 00:19:05,769
[stammering] Are you seeing this?

262
00:19:05,853 --> 00:19:09,022
-What?
-This!

263
00:19:09,106 --> 00:19:11,400
What do you mean, Hon? Another customer?

264
00:19:11,483 --> 00:19:12,359
Right there?!

265
00:19:16,363 --> 00:19:17,698
-I'm sorry.
-What's happening?

266
00:19:17,781 --> 00:19:18,824
We have to go.

267
00:19:18,907 --> 00:19:19,825
-No!
-Wrap this up.

268
00:19:19,908 --> 00:19:20,659
-Arnaldo, sit down.
-Wait.

269
00:19:20,742 --> 00:19:21,994
No, no, no. We have to go.

270
00:19:22,077 --> 00:19:23,996
No, we have to finish the food tasting.

271
00:19:24,079 --> 00:19:26,623
Come on. We're running out of time.

272
00:19:26,707 --> 00:19:29,001
-We're good. Come on, let's go!
-Hon.

273
00:19:29,585 --> 00:19:33,755
People are watching.
Sit down. We should finish this.

274
00:19:36,633 --> 00:19:39,178
Okay, what's next? This one.

275
00:19:42,181 --> 00:19:43,015
[clears throat]

276
00:19:50,230 --> 00:19:51,732
<i>Wear those.</i>

277
00:19:51,815 --> 00:19:56,320
<i>And don't take them off until</i>
<i>you hear Arnaldo going berserk.</i>

278
00:19:56,403 --> 00:19:58,363
<i>-Understood?</i>
<i>-Yes, ma'am.</i>

279
00:19:59,198 --> 00:20:00,490
<i>Do it properly.</i>

280
00:20:08,749 --> 00:20:11,585
Hon… Can you please behave?

281
00:20:12,211 --> 00:20:13,253
-No, we should go.
-It's embarrassing--

282
00:20:13,337 --> 00:20:15,756
Let… let's go. Let's go. Let's go now.

283
00:20:15,839 --> 00:20:19,176
-Arnaldo, we don't have?
-I don't care! Let's go.

284
00:20:19,259 --> 00:20:20,260
Let's go!

285
00:20:20,344 --> 00:20:21,428
Hon…

286
00:20:23,931 --> 00:20:25,015
What are you doing?!

287
00:20:25,098 --> 00:20:26,892
-Are you taking a video of me?!
-What's wrong with you?

288
00:20:26,975 --> 00:20:28,477
-Hon!
-You?! What's wrong with you?!

289
00:20:28,560 --> 00:20:29,811
-Hon!
-What?!

290
00:20:29,895 --> 00:20:30,938
-Is that your phone?
-Stop it!

291
00:20:31,021 --> 00:20:32,773
-You gonna fight back?
-Hon! Arnaldo, relax.

292
00:20:32,856 --> 00:20:35,359
It's embarrassing. Let's go. Come!

293
00:20:35,442 --> 00:20:36,902
-You too?!
-Stop it!

294
00:20:36,985 --> 00:20:38,528
-All you? Put your phone down!
-Arnaldo…

295
00:20:40,364 --> 00:20:43,242
Hon, let's go. What's happening to you?!

296
00:20:45,535 --> 00:20:46,578
Come on!

297
00:20:47,496 --> 00:20:48,997
Hon! Hon.

298
00:20:50,165 --> 00:20:52,751
I'm sorry… Let's go.

299
00:20:54,169 --> 00:20:55,837
Get the car ready, now!

300
00:20:57,047 --> 00:20:59,633
Mr. Torillo, we don't have
the information you need.

301
00:21:00,676 --> 00:21:03,262
Besides, it's hard to go
against the Ardientes.

302
00:21:03,345 --> 00:21:06,974
If there's one person who knows
them well, it would be me.

303
00:21:07,641 --> 00:21:09,142
I lived with them before,

304
00:21:09,226 --> 00:21:12,479
so I know how they act
and what their weaknesses are.

305
00:21:12,562 --> 00:21:15,732
-But, sir…
-We won't drag you into this.

306
00:21:20,195 --> 00:21:23,031
If you really pledged
to perform your duties,

307
00:21:23,740 --> 00:21:27,995
then you will give us
the information we need.

308
00:21:29,663 --> 00:21:32,916
Where can we find Arnaldo's witness?

309
00:21:35,502 --> 00:21:38,171
[tense music playing]

310
00:21:47,431 --> 00:21:48,557
[sighs]

311
00:21:51,184 --> 00:21:54,229
-Hello, Aunt Claire!
-Emilia! What's happening?

312
00:21:54,855 --> 00:21:56,273
You made me come all the way here.

313
00:21:56,732 --> 00:21:58,692
Auntie, I have a surprise for you.

314
00:21:59,276 --> 00:22:00,360
[chuckles]

315
00:22:00,444 --> 00:22:04,031
I have a video of Diego talking to Jaguar.

316
00:22:04,114 --> 00:22:07,075
And I will send it to Papa.
And when he sees it…

317
00:22:07,159 --> 00:22:09,911
I'll make Papa so happy again, Auntie.

318
00:22:09,995 --> 00:22:13,165
And… Of course, he needs to reward me.

319
00:22:13,248 --> 00:22:16,585
He should allow me to run for a seat

320
00:22:16,668 --> 00:22:19,546
in congress or for governor.

321
00:22:23,759 --> 00:22:25,844
You know what, Auntie?
I cannot believe this.

322
00:22:26,303 --> 00:22:29,056
Emilia is back. I am so, so back.

323
00:22:29,139 --> 00:22:33,393
And I don't need to flirt
with Jaguar anymore

324
00:22:33,477 --> 00:22:37,105
to get on his good side.
What do you think?

325
00:22:38,023 --> 00:22:39,274
[scoffs]

326
00:22:39,357 --> 00:22:40,442
Emilia…

327
00:22:40,901 --> 00:22:43,153
Once your father hears about this,

328
00:22:43,236 --> 00:22:45,072
he'll belittle you again.

329
00:22:45,739 --> 00:22:46,823
What did he tell you?

330
00:22:46,907 --> 00:22:48,992
He told you to get rid of Jaguar, right?

331
00:22:49,076 --> 00:22:50,535
Not flirt with him.

332
00:22:50,619 --> 00:22:52,412
Now, tell me.

333
00:22:52,496 --> 00:22:55,457
How will you gain his trust? Do tell.

334
00:22:55,540 --> 00:22:59,002
Aunt Claire, you came all
the way here just to scold me?

335
00:22:59,086 --> 00:23:00,754
I cannot believe this, Auntie.

336
00:23:00,837 --> 00:23:03,090
You know, if you just came here
to get mad at me,

337
00:23:03,173 --> 00:23:04,674
please just leave. Please leave me alone.

338
00:23:04,758 --> 00:23:06,551
I am just concerned, Emilia.

339
00:23:06,635 --> 00:23:09,638
Auntie, bye. Leave me alone first.

340
00:23:09,721 --> 00:23:10,639
[scoffs]

341
00:23:10,722 --> 00:23:11,807
Use your head, Emilia.

342
00:23:14,810 --> 00:23:18,188
[ominous music playing]

343
00:23:21,233 --> 00:23:22,859
It's a brilliant idea.

344
00:23:30,826 --> 00:23:31,868
[sighs]

345
00:23:42,045 --> 00:23:44,756
[ominous music playing]

346
00:23:56,309 --> 00:23:59,229
[sighs] What are you doing here?
Can you leave me alone?

347
00:24:00,772 --> 00:24:02,065
[distorted voice] I know, Emilia.

348
00:24:02,732 --> 00:24:05,610
Why don't you just accept my offer?

349
00:24:06,278 --> 00:24:09,447
Join me and leave your father.

350
00:24:12,993 --> 00:24:17,581
If you choose to come with me,
you'll have everything you want.

351
00:24:18,665 --> 00:24:20,125
I will make you my queen.

352
00:24:21,126 --> 00:24:22,794
If you stop helping Diego.

353
00:24:22,878 --> 00:24:26,590
I know you helped him get out of prison.

354
00:24:27,799 --> 00:24:29,426
Diego is the greatest hindrance

355
00:24:30,260 --> 00:24:32,971
to Arnaldo's political ambitions.

356
00:24:34,055 --> 00:24:37,893
The only way Arnaldo
can beat Diego is if he cheats.

357
00:24:39,728 --> 00:24:43,690
That's why I want you and Diego
to be my allies.

358
00:24:43,773 --> 00:24:45,483
My dream team.

359
00:24:45,567 --> 00:24:48,361
So I can finally take down the Ardientes.

360
00:24:48,445 --> 00:24:51,656
That's why you need
to think about my offer.

361
00:24:56,244 --> 00:24:57,829
[phone ringing]

362
00:24:57,913 --> 00:24:59,581
Just a minute. I have to take this.

363
00:25:00,540 --> 00:25:01,583
Hello.

364
00:25:03,585 --> 00:25:04,586
What?

365
00:25:07,339 --> 00:25:09,382
Get out of here. You have to leave now.

366
00:25:13,345 --> 00:25:15,180
Think about it, Emilia.

367
00:25:15,263 --> 00:25:16,306
Arnaldo.

368
00:25:18,975 --> 00:25:20,352
And this Jaguar.

369
00:25:22,520 --> 00:25:23,647
[door opens]

370
00:25:24,731 --> 00:25:27,943
Andres Macaraig. Can we talk to you?

371
00:25:28,026 --> 00:25:29,319
We have nothing to talk about.

372
00:25:29,402 --> 00:25:30,528
Stop.

373
00:25:33,907 --> 00:25:35,200
I just have one question.

374
00:25:36,660 --> 00:25:40,830
Did Arnaldo pay you to testify against me?

375
00:25:46,711 --> 00:25:48,255
-[Ivy] <i>This is embarrassing</i>…
-[Arnaldo] <i>Let's go. Let's go.</i>

376
00:25:48,338 --> 00:25:49,756
<i>-Hon…</i>
<i>-I don't care!</i>

377
00:25:49,839 --> 00:25:52,592
This is not happening.
I think I'm palpitating.

378
00:25:52,676 --> 00:25:54,344
This is not happening, Arnaldo!

379
00:25:54,427 --> 00:25:56,388
What the hell have you been doing!?

380
00:25:56,471 --> 00:25:57,472
Oh, my…

381
00:25:59,891 --> 00:26:01,643
I'll talk to your doctor.

382
00:26:01,726 --> 00:26:03,728
He's been giving you the wrong medication.

383
00:26:03,812 --> 00:26:04,688
Emilia, there's no need.

384
00:26:04,771 --> 00:26:07,274
I've talked to another doctor.
We have an appointment tomorrow.

385
00:26:07,357 --> 00:26:09,401
Stay out of this. You're just his fiancée.

386
00:26:09,484 --> 00:26:10,360
I'm his mother!

387
00:26:10,443 --> 00:26:12,737
My opinion matters more than yours!

388
00:26:12,821 --> 00:26:14,656
You know, even though
you're Arnaldo's mother,

389
00:26:14,739 --> 00:26:17,534
I know that you're
planning something, Emilia.

390
00:26:17,617 --> 00:26:21,579
You'll use it against Arnaldo.
You'll call him incompetent,

391
00:26:21,663 --> 00:26:23,915
so you can take his place. Right?

392
00:26:23,999 --> 00:26:25,917
I know you, future mother-in-law.

393
00:26:26,001 --> 00:26:28,086
That's how your mind works, doesn't it?

394
00:26:28,169 --> 00:26:30,964
Wow, Ivy. Really?

395
00:26:31,047 --> 00:26:34,175
You know, ever since you entered
my son's life,

396
00:26:34,259 --> 00:26:35,802
ever since you became his fiancée,

397
00:26:35,885 --> 00:26:37,679
he's started acting crazy!

398
00:26:37,762 --> 00:26:39,806
-That's enough!
-You're blaming me again.

399
00:26:39,889 --> 00:26:40,682
-That's enough!
-Hon.

400
00:26:40,765 --> 00:26:42,142
I'm not crazy, okay?

401
00:26:42,225 --> 00:26:43,935
I'm the mayor of this town
and soon-to-be governor.

402
00:26:44,019 --> 00:26:45,770
-Nothing will change.
-You won't attend the debate!

403
00:26:45,854 --> 00:26:47,689
You'll only make a fool
of yourself, Arnaldo!

404
00:26:47,772 --> 00:26:50,817
Listen to me! I am still your mother!

405
00:26:51,568 --> 00:26:52,652
Arnaldo!

406
00:26:53,987 --> 00:26:55,071
[huffs]

407
00:26:57,282 --> 00:26:58,950
[phone ringing]

408
00:27:05,081 --> 00:27:05,832
Diego.

409
00:27:05,915 --> 00:27:08,335
Ivy, we found Arnaldo's witness.

410
00:27:09,336 --> 00:27:12,839
And he agreed to testify for us
if he has to.

411
00:27:13,256 --> 00:27:14,758
That's good.

412
00:27:15,425 --> 00:27:17,844
Do you know what's happening
to Arnaldo right now?

413
00:27:17,927 --> 00:27:19,679
He's losing his mind.

414
00:27:19,763 --> 00:27:21,598
<i>That's why during tomorrow's debate,</i>

415
00:27:21,681 --> 00:27:23,475
the entire province will discover

416
00:27:23,558 --> 00:27:25,769
what's wrong with Arnaldo.

417
00:27:26,102 --> 00:27:27,562
He's gone insane.

418
00:27:28,730 --> 00:27:29,814
Thank you, Ivy.

419
00:27:40,825 --> 00:27:42,827
Batch, you've got this.

420
00:27:43,328 --> 00:27:46,498
You're sincere and you're articulate too.

421
00:27:46,915 --> 00:27:49,250
As long as Arnaldo's side
doesn't pull any stunts,

422
00:27:49,334 --> 00:27:51,753
I know you'll win the debate
and the election too.

423
00:27:53,463 --> 00:27:54,547
Thank you, Batch.

424
00:27:55,048 --> 00:27:56,925
-It's expensive. [laughs]
-It is. Oh.

425
00:27:57,675 --> 00:27:59,677
Diego, are you ready?

426
00:28:01,137 --> 00:28:02,305
Born ready.

427
00:28:02,972 --> 00:28:06,017
I'll reveal all of Arnaldo's secrets.

428
00:28:07,227 --> 00:28:09,062
I know we can win this.

429
00:28:11,189 --> 00:28:14,442
That's right. Just keep fighting. Fight!

430
00:28:15,819 --> 00:28:19,697
[tender music playing]

431
00:28:32,043 --> 00:28:33,753
This dress! I hate it!

432
00:28:34,254 --> 00:28:35,755
It's so uncomfortable!

433
00:28:35,839 --> 00:28:39,634
Emilia, have you seen
Arnaldo's video clips?

434
00:28:41,261 --> 00:28:42,011
If you ask me,

435
00:28:42,095 --> 00:28:44,597
I don't think he should be
making any TV appearances.

436
00:28:44,681 --> 00:28:46,850
He isn't ready for the debate.

437
00:28:46,933 --> 00:28:49,144
[sighs] Honestly, I really don't know.

438
00:28:49,561 --> 00:28:51,104
All I know right now is

439
00:28:51,187 --> 00:28:53,231
this dress doesn't suit me at all.

440
00:28:53,898 --> 00:28:55,275
Oh, Raul.

441
00:28:55,358 --> 00:28:57,777
You know that son of ours
never listens to us.

442
00:28:57,861 --> 00:28:59,946
I don't know why I have to attend

443
00:29:00,029 --> 00:29:01,614
that stupid debate, either.

444
00:29:02,574 --> 00:29:05,160
I'll be forced to mingle
with everyone there again.

445
00:29:07,662 --> 00:29:08,663
No.

446
00:29:10,206 --> 00:29:14,419
FUEGO RESTAURANT AT 7 PM.
DON'T BE LATE.

447
00:29:14,502 --> 00:29:17,464
[pensive music playing]

448
00:29:18,131 --> 00:29:19,257
[phone chimes]

449
00:29:28,141 --> 00:29:32,061
FUEGO RESTAURANT AT 7 PM.
DON'T BE LATE.

450
00:29:38,651 --> 00:29:41,154
What's wrong?
Why are you staring like that?

451
00:29:42,113 --> 00:29:43,198
Um…

452
00:29:49,329 --> 00:29:50,955
Will you attend the debate later?

453
00:29:53,625 --> 00:29:55,293
If I need to, I don't see why not.

454
00:29:56,544 --> 00:29:59,672
Do you have anything planned
after the debate?

455
00:30:02,258 --> 00:30:04,803
Not really. What about you?

456
00:30:07,222 --> 00:30:08,890
Raul, can you do me a favor, please?

457
00:30:09,432 --> 00:30:11,226
Can you unbutton my dress?

458
00:30:22,320 --> 00:30:23,655
Do you have a date?

459
00:30:27,450 --> 00:30:29,744
Well, it's for you to find out.

460
00:30:38,086 --> 00:30:39,379
[camera flashes]

461
00:30:39,462 --> 00:30:42,674
Ma'am, are you confident
your side win this debate?

462
00:30:42,757 --> 00:30:44,509
Do you really have to ask that?

463
00:30:44,592 --> 00:30:47,178
Of course, yes! We're gonna win this.

464
00:30:47,262 --> 00:30:48,972
Sir, how about you?
Are you confident you'll win?

465
00:30:49,055 --> 00:30:52,475
-Viva Ardiente!
-Viva Ardiente!

466
00:30:52,559 --> 00:30:54,435
-Viva Ardiente!
-See? One hundred percent.

467
00:30:54,519 --> 00:31:00,066
Viva Ardiente! Viva Ardiente!
Viva Ardiente! Viva Ardiente!

468
00:31:00,149 --> 00:31:03,903
Viva Ardiente! Viva Ardiente!

469
00:31:03,987 --> 00:31:05,572
Viva Ardiente!

470
00:31:19,252 --> 00:31:20,295
Yes. Thank you.

471
00:31:29,178 --> 00:31:31,514
-Viva Ardiente!
-For the new Ardiente!

472
00:31:31,598 --> 00:31:34,058
Mr. Diego, can you say
you're ready for this?

473
00:31:34,142 --> 00:31:35,310
I was born ready.

474
00:31:35,393 --> 00:31:38,021
Are you confident you'll win this debate?

475
00:31:38,730 --> 00:31:41,232
Let's just wait and see
what happens later.

476
00:31:41,316 --> 00:31:42,567
-Thank you.
-Thank you, sir.

477
00:31:42,650 --> 00:31:45,737
-For a new Ardiente!
-Diego Torillo!

478
00:31:45,820 --> 00:31:47,363
For a new Ardiente!

479
00:32:08,635 --> 00:32:11,054
[tense music playing]

480
00:32:21,522 --> 00:32:24,317
In just half an hour, the two brothers,

481
00:32:24,400 --> 00:32:27,320
<i>Arnaldo Ardiente-Torillo</i>
<i>and Diego Ardiente-Torillo,</i>

482
00:32:27,403 --> 00:32:30,698
<i>will face off in a debate</i>
<i>for Poblacion Ardiente.</i>

483
00:32:30,782 --> 00:32:32,700
<i>The two candidates for governor</i>

484
00:32:32,784 --> 00:32:34,410
<i>will be talking about their platforms</i>

485
00:32:34,494 --> 00:32:38,498
and addressing the many issues
thrown their way.

486
00:32:38,581 --> 00:32:40,959
This is the first time
the brothers will be meeting

487
00:32:41,042 --> 00:32:43,878
since Diego Torillo
was released from prison

488
00:32:43,962 --> 00:32:49,467
and the videos of Mayor Arnaldo
Torillo's outburst went viral.

489
00:32:54,222 --> 00:32:56,641
-[cheering]
-Viva Ardiente!

490
00:32:57,141 --> 00:32:58,393
Ardiente! Ardiente!

491
00:32:58,476 --> 00:32:59,978
I don't think I can do this.

492
00:33:00,061 --> 00:33:02,814
Hon, you can't just back out.

493
00:33:03,731 --> 00:33:08,027
You'll disappoint your family.
Your supporters too.

494
00:33:08,111 --> 00:33:10,363
Think about what
your grandfather's going to say.

495
00:33:10,989 --> 00:33:13,157
Do you really want to disappoint him?

496
00:33:14,534 --> 00:33:15,660
You can do this!

497
00:33:16,786 --> 00:33:18,538
I believe in you, Arnaldo.

498
00:33:18,913 --> 00:33:21,833
[supporters continue cheering]

499
00:33:22,750 --> 00:33:23,793
-Thank you.
-See?

500
00:33:23,876 --> 00:33:25,962
The people are waiting. Let's go?

501
00:33:26,045 --> 00:33:28,965
