502
00:33:29,048 --> 00:33:31,259
[supporters cheering]

503
00:33:32,593 --> 00:33:33,761
[phone chimes]

504
00:33:37,306 --> 00:33:39,183
WE'RE HERE.

505
00:33:42,812 --> 00:33:43,896
WE'RE ALL SET.

506
00:33:43,980 --> 00:33:46,024
Viva Ardiente! Viva Ardiente!

507
00:33:46,107 --> 00:33:48,526
-WE'RE HERE.
-WE'RE READY TOO.

508
00:33:48,609 --> 00:33:49,986
Viva Ardiente!

509
00:33:52,989 --> 00:33:54,198
