Or is it just propaganda?

553
00:35:34,632 --> 00:35:37,343
Did you know that Mayor Arnaldo's

554
00:35:37,426 --> 00:35:39,178
throwing a fit outside?

555
00:35:39,637 --> 00:35:43,891
His huge poster got vandalized
with the word murderer on it.

556
00:35:43,975 --> 00:35:46,686
