-They set it all up.

564
00:36:12,920 --> 00:36:15,173
Hon, everyone's looking at you. Relax.

565
00:36:21,053 --> 00:36:22,180
Are you okay?

566
00:36:22,263 --> 00:36:24,307
I'm okay. I'm okay.

567
00:36:28,519 --> 00:36:29,645
Is he okay?

568
00:36:30,396 --> 00:36:32,231
Yes. He's okay now.

569
00:36:32,773 --> 00:36:38,279
[tense music playing]

570
00:36:58,341 --> 00:36:59,217
