00:37:18,110 --> 00:37:21,530
Diego Torillo! For a new Ardiente!

577
00:37:21,614 --> 00:37:25,326
Diego Torillo! For a new Ardiente!

578
00:37:25,409 --> 00:37:28,955
Diego Torillo! For a new Ardiente!

579
00:37:29,038 --> 00:37:32,333
Diego Torillo! For a new Ardiente!

580
00:37:32,416 --> 00:37:36,045
Diego Torillo! For a new Ardiente!

