584
00:37:58,025 --> 00:37:59,026
I'm fine. I'm fine.

585
00:38:01,320 --> 00:38:03,239
Um… I'm fine.

586
00:38:06,242 --> 00:38:07,410
Actually, Ivy…

587
00:38:08,744 --> 00:38:12,164
Ivy, that was a bad move, right?

588
00:38:12,248 --> 00:38:15,042
