to take part in this debate.

597
00:38:36,731 --> 00:38:38,566
Hon, you can do this.

598
00:38:39,734 --> 00:38:45,448
If ever you feel nervous
or really anxious,

599
00:38:45,865 --> 00:38:47,241
just look at me, okay?

600
00:38:48,034 --> 00:38:51,746
