to support you all the way.

601
00:38:55,333 --> 00:38:57,877
You can do this, hon. You can do this.

602
00:38:58,461 --> 00:38:59,920
-I can do this.
-Yes.

603
00:39:00,004 --> 00:39:01,797
Thank you. Thank you.

604
00:39:03,132 --> 00:39:04,133
Thank you.

605
00:39:05,009 --> 00:39:06,010
Thank you.

606
00:39:06,802 --> 00:39:07,845
